        "text": "else if(Gear!=null&&(int)Gear.Weapon>=2&&Ready)AimPreview=CombatAim.Solve(hero,MuzzlePosition,MuzzleSource,(Gear.Weapon==GearType.Bow?23:16)*2.5f);"
